all year long.

81
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,050
And here...

82
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:08,030
A free vacation.

83
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:10,570
Accommodation is available
at the nature campground

84
00:04:10,570 --> 00:04:11,490
on my farm.

85
00:04:11,490 --> 00:04:12,460
Whoa...

86
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:13,990
