97
00:04:35,980 --> 00:04:36,960
because

98
00:04:37,659 --> 00:04:39,230
I'll be a resident here.

99
00:04:39,450 --> 00:04:39,790
Oh?

100
00:04:39,790 --> 00:04:41,480
You're going to purchase a house here?

101
00:04:41,870 --> 00:04:42,850
Indeed.

102
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,460
Uh, sir.

103
00:04:48,460 --> 00:04:49,130
Excuse me.

104
00:04:49,490 --> 00:04:51,670
Which one is Mr. Jiranat's house?

105
00:04:53,090 --> 00:04:54,050
All of them, actually.

106
00:04:54,290 --> 00:04:56,030
Mr. Jiranat owns this residential project.

107
00:04:58,670 --> 00:04:59,930
This is nothing fancy.

108
00:04:59,930 --> 00:05:03,220
I'm just buying a house from
my soon-to-be partner's residential project.

109
00:05:04,350 --> 00:05:05,970
I haven't introduced myself, actually.

110
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:07,410
I'm...

111
00:05:07,430 --> 00:05:08,490
Sarm Traiphop.

112
00:05:08,860 --> 00:05:09,440
Right.

113
00:05:09,440 --> 00:05:10,530
Pleasure to meet you, sir.

114
00:05:10,530 --> 00:05:12,010
I'm Poj, a security guard.

115
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:12,810
It's nice to meet you.

116
00:05:14,860 --> 00:05:16,520
I'm off to see Mr. Jam now.

117
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:18,530
Today, I'm doing things properly.

118
00:05:18,550 --> 00:05:19,390
Don't worry.

119
00:05:19,510 --> 00:05:20,330
- Right.
- Alright.

120
00:05:20,350 --> 00:05:21,330
- Go ahead.
- Right.

121
00:05:25,830 --> 00:05:26,680
Little Jam.

122
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,060
Little Jam...

123
00:05:39,470 --> 00:05:40,150
Little Jam...

124
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,030
Little Jam!

125
00:05:47,090 --> 00:05:48,400
Is he alright?

126
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:53,490
Little Jam!

127
00:06:16,060 --> 00:06:16,890
Little Jam...

128
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:18,330
Is he fine?

129
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:45,490
Need to change into flip-flops,

130
00:06:45,770 --> 00:06:46,860
or else I'll get scolded.

131
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:57,640
The door isn't locked either.

132
00:06:58,950 --> 00:07:00,280
Why is he so careless about security?

133
00:07:06,930 --> 00:07:08,000
Mr. Sarm?

134
00:07:08,490 --> 00:07:09,840
How did you come in?

135
00:07:16,930 --> 00:07:18,120
Little Jam.

136
00:07:18,710 --> 00:07:19,480
I'm sorry.

137
00:07:22,060 --> 00:07:24,460
I just let myself in

138
00:07:24,570 --> 00:07:25,660
because this door

139
00:07:26,640 --> 00:07:27,730
wasn't locked.

140
00:07:28,770 --> 00:07:30,280
That wasn't my intention.

141
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,660
Actually,

142
00:07:32,490 --> 00:07:34,060
I texted you earlier,

143
00:07:34,770 --> 00:07:35,700
but you didn't reply.

144
00:07:36,610 --> 00:07:37,159
I called you...

145
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:38,520
but you didn't answer.

146
00:07:39,790 --> 00:07:40,890
So I got worried,

147
00:07:41,550 --> 00:07:42,960
thinking that something happened to you.

148
00:07:45,210 --> 00:07:46,580
So I trespassed.

149
00:07:49,659 --> 00:07:50,560
I'm sorry.

150
00:07:53,110 --> 00:07:54,909
I was probably zoning out.

151
00:08:13,090 --> 00:08:13,860
Little Jam.

152
00:08:14,290 --> 00:08:15,670
Are you sick?

153
00:08:17,370 --> 00:08:18,230
Oh...

154
00:08:18,710 --> 00:08:19,790
I'm feeling better now.

155
00:08:19,990 --> 00:08:21,290
I already took my medications.

156
00:08:25,830 --> 00:08:27,160
Have you eaten?

157
00:08:37,799 --> 00:08:39,370
Why are you like this?

158
00:08:41,950 --> 00:08:42,970
If that's the case...

159
00:08:43,970 --> 00:08:45,230
allow me to use the kitchen.

160
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,170
Right.

161
00:08:50,860 --> 00:08:52,280
I didn't order anything.

162
00:08:52,470 --> 00:08:53,260
I did.

163
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:20,860
Boiled crabs,

164
00:09:20,860 --> 00:09:22,060
your favorite.

165
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:23,260
Where are the crabs?

166
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,460
Here.

167
00:09:29,640 --> 00:09:30,650
I am not in the mood.

168
00:09:32,380 --> 00:09:33,100
Fine...

169
00:09:33,930 --> 00:09:35,290
Let me use the kitchen, then.

170
00:09:45,030 --> 00:09:46,060
Are you hungry?

171
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,290
A little.

172
00:09:52,150 --> 00:09:53,470
Have a hot bowl of soup.

173
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:55,310
It'll help you get better quicker.

174
00:09:58,510 --> 00:09:59,650
Thank you.

175
00:10:08,730 --> 00:10:10,470
Once it cools down, put it in the fridge.

176
00:10:10,690 --> 00:10:11,850
You can reheat it for tomorrow.

177
00:10:13,700 --> 00:10:14,900
Thank you.

178
00:10:17,590 --> 00:10:19,250
Can you change that word
to something else?

179
00:10:20,170 --> 00:10:21,120
To what?

180
00:10:30,810 --> 00:10:32,160
Can I stay here for one night?

181
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:44,190
Please?

182
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:47,530
Please?

183
00:10:50,290 --> 00:10:51,200
Please?

184
00:10:53,390 --> 00:10:54,650
You rode your motorbike here?

185
00:10:54,650 --> 00:10:55,660
That's...right.

186
00:10:55,660 --> 00:10:57,210
I vroomed, vroomed,
vroomed my way here

187
00:10:57,690 --> 00:10:59,130
so I could arrive sooner.

188
00:10:59,350 --> 00:11:01,060
I wanted to see you as soon as possible

189
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:02,470
because I was worried about you.

190
00:11:03,460 --> 00:11:05,340
By the time he rides back from here...

191
00:11:05,370 --> 00:11:06,820
