192
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:09,520
He will probably fly down the road
rather than just ride along.

193
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,890
Dangerous...

194
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:13,030
I am worried about him.

195
00:11:13,030 --> 00:11:13,780
Fine.

196
00:11:16,230 --> 00:11:17,120
Oh...

197
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:20,860
The guest room has recently been repainted.

198
00:11:21,090 --> 00:11:22,520
It still smells like paint.

199
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,120
Oh,

200
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:24,230
