201
00:11:24,410 --> 00:11:25,760
I can sleep on the couch.

202
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:26,470
I'm easygoing,

203
00:11:26,710 --> 00:11:27,590
not a picky eater.

204
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:28,750
I'm also low-maintenance.

205
00:11:29,550 --> 00:11:30,790
I'll do just fine in any scenario.

206
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:32,580
I can even sleep on the floor.

207
00:11:33,510 --> 00:11:34,050
Right.

208
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:35,680
Sure.

209
00:11:39,390 --> 00:11:40,060
Yes!

210
00:11:40,060 --> 00:11:40,690
Hm?

211
00:11:42,990 --> 00:11:43,660
Ah.

212
00:11:44,330 --> 00:11:45,200
It's the black pepper.

213
00:11:45,370 --> 00:11:46,320
It stings.

214
00:11:46,780 --> 00:11:47,870
Are you okay?

215
00:11:47,870 --> 00:11:48,730
I am, yes.

216
00:11:49,110 --> 00:11:50,510
I really am.

217
00:11:56,190 --> 00:11:59,120
♫You're my love battery♫

218
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:01,850
♫I've never been someone's priority♫

219
00:12:01,850 --> 00:12:04,320
♫Always been through heartbreak endlessly♫

220
00:12:05,260 --> 00:12:06,150
Yes!

221
00:12:09,030 --> 00:12:11,490
♫So many have come into my life and left me♫

222
00:12:11,490 --> 00:12:15,680
♫I've got nobody to stay right here beside me♫

223
00:12:16,510 --> 00:12:18,090
♫All alone...♫

224
00:12:24,250 --> 00:12:27,480
♫All alone, I'm restless night and day♫

225
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:29,970
♫My heart just doesn't feel okay♫

226
00:12:29,970 --> 00:12:33,840
♫Like this, even paracetamol
won't make it go away♫

227
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:37,130
♫But then you came
and stirred things up this way♫

228
00:12:37,130 --> 00:12:39,210
♫And my heart began to change♫

229
00:12:39,230 --> 00:12:42,460
♫I just want you to know…♫

230
00:12:42,460 --> 00:12:48,840
♫You're the positive energy
in my life whenever I'm tired♫

231
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:51,830
♫Just having you near...♫

232
00:12:51,830 --> 00:12:54,740
♫You charge my heart
and bring me back to life♫

233
00:13:23,520 --> 00:13:24,640
Mr. Sarm.

234
00:13:32,290 --> 00:13:33,360
Yes, Little Jam?

235
00:13:34,180 --> 00:13:35,020
Here,

236
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,340
your towel and clothes.

237
00:13:36,570 --> 00:13:38,500
Use the bathroom downstairs.

238
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,720
As for the worn clothes,

239
00:13:41,010 --> 00:13:43,280
toss them in the rattan basket
by the bathroom.

240
00:13:43,470 --> 00:13:45,170
I will dry the laundry.

241
00:13:46,830 --> 00:13:47,710
Okay.

242
00:13:49,370 --> 00:13:51,760
Let me get the bedding for you,

243
00:13:52,370 --> 00:13:53,650
but hang tight

244
00:13:54,110 --> 00:13:55,380
