245
00:13:55,660 --> 00:13:56,860
You can't, Little Jam.

246
00:14:00,300 --> 00:14:01,680
Just give yourself a sponge bath.

247
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:03,870
You're still warm to the touch.

248
00:14:05,550 --> 00:14:07,070
I am taking a warm shower.

249
00:14:08,610 --> 00:14:09,710
Are you sure?

250
00:14:10,190 --> 00:14:10,590
Mm.

251
00:14:10,710 --> 00:14:11,490
Okay.

252
00:14:11,760 --> 00:14:12,460
Okay, sure.

253
00:14:13,140 --> 00:14:14,150
Okay.

254
00:15:14,270 --> 00:15:14,860
Little Jam.

255
00:15:16,650 --> 00:15:18,460
Here is your pillow and blanket, Mr. Sarm.

256
00:15:20,860 --> 00:15:21,490
Thank you.

257
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:31,920
Sweet dreams.

258
00:15:33,290 --> 00:15:34,240
Sweet dreams.

259
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:40,060
Little Jam.

260
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:48,460
By the way...

261
00:15:49,230 --> 00:15:50,240
Is Juju not here?

262
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,680
