when I was in Pak Chong.

275
00:16:18,090 --> 00:16:18,950
Meow.

276
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:24,050
I'll be your cat, then.

277
00:16:25,830 --> 00:16:27,590
My cat is only this tiny.

278
00:16:29,590 --> 00:16:30,680
Just like you.

279
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,680
You're this tiny...

280
00:16:34,730 --> 00:16:35,770
But here...

281
00:16:37,950 --> 00:16:39,040
So chubby.

