335
00:20:06,750 --> 00:20:07,660
"I love you, Little Jam."

336
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:08,860
"I love you, Little Jam."

337
00:20:09,260 --> 00:20:10,230
"I love you, Little Jam."

338
00:20:10,390 --> 00:20:11,260
"I love you, Little Jam."

339
00:20:11,850 --> 00:20:12,770
"I love you, Little Jam."

